      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Many healthcare professionals are aware of the management protocols for nociceptive pain. However, the diagnosis and management of neuropathic pain remains, for many. a confusing and uncertain topic. This paper looks at neuropathic pain management in two countries, Poland and the Republic of Ireland, and discusses the analgesic strategies for the management of this common type of pain."},
